/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 130 0 R
/T (Computers do not natively understand human words; they only process numbers \(zeros and ones\). Language AI works by transforming unstructured human language into numerical representations, processing those numbers through neural networks, and converting the outputs back into text or structured predictions.)
/E (Computers do not natively understand human words; they only process numbers \(zeros and ones\). Language AI works by transforming unstructured human language into numerical representations, processing those numbers through neural networks, and converting the outputs back into text or structured predictions.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
