/P 131 0 R
/T (Here is a step-by-step breakdown of how modern Language AI systems operate under the hood: 1. Tokenization \(Breaking Down the Text\) Before an AI model can analyze a text prompt, the text passes through a tokenizer. Tokenization splits unstructured text into smaller chunks called tokens, which can be individual words, subwords, or characters.)
/E (Here is a step-by-step breakdown of how modern Language AI systems operate under the hood: 1. Tokenization \(Breaking Down the Text\) Before an AI model can analyze a text prompt, the text passes through a tokenizer. Tokenization splits unstructured text into smaller chunks called tokens, which can be individual words, subwords, or characters.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
