/T (4. Autoregressive Prediction & Generation Generative Language AI models are completion machines. They operate autoregressively, meaning they generate output text one token at a time. At each step, the model computes a probability distribution over its entire vocabulary to pick the most likely next token, appends that token to its context, and repeats the loop.)
