/T (Language, however, is a tricky concept for computers. Text is unstructured in nature and loses its meaning when represented by zeros and ones \(individual characters\). As a result, throughout the history of Language AI, there has been a large focus on representing language in a structured manner so that it can more easily be used by computers. Examples of these Language AI tasks are provided in Figure 1-2.)
