/T (Released in 2013, word2vec was one of the first successful attempts at capturing the meaning of text in embeddings. Embeddings are vector representations of data that attempt to capture its meaning. To do so, word2vec learns semantic representations of words by training on vast amounts of textual data, like the entirety of Wikipedia. )
