/T (Using these neural networks, word2vec generates word embeddings by looking at which other words they tend to appear next to in a given sentence. We start by assigning every word in our vocabulary with a vector embedding, say of 50 values for each word initialized with random values. Then in every training step, as illustrated in Figure 1-7, we take pairs of words from the training data and a model attempts to predict whether or not they are likely to be neighbors in a sentence)
