/Title (Language AI \(Language Artificial Intelligence\) is a specialized branch of artificial intelligence dedicated to creating technologies that can understand, process, and generate human language. Because of the widespread success of machine learning in solving complex text tasks, the term Language AI is often used interchangeably with Natural Language Processing \(NLP\). While high-profile Large Language Models \(LLMs\) like ChatGPT have brought massive attention to the field, Language AI spans a much broader ecosystem. It includes:)
